                          "name": "Rationale",
                          "fill": "$text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Snapping guides, spacing pills and distance lines need a hue that never reads as selection (blue), agent (teal) or status (green / amber / red). Magenta is the one free slot on the wheel, sits far from danger red, and stays legible on warm-grey canvases and white artboards. It is the only new hue in M2; measure-soft is the same hue at 12–18% for gap fills.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                          "fontSize": "$text-sm",
