              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Real size, anchored to the right-panel row that opens them. Popovers open to the left of the 280 panel with an 8px gap, their top edge exactly on the trigger row's top, and clamp to the viewport. Selects inside the panel and popovers open a Menu/Dense 4px below the trigger, left-aligned. Fill rows list the top paint first (Linear · Image · Solid), as on board 08.",
