                      "fill": "$text-tertiary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 208,
                      "content": "Selects in the right panel open this. Radius-lg like Menu, 28px items, 14px check slot always reserved (Check enabled:false when unchecked) so labels align. Checked = $bg-hover + check + 500. Optional mono Meta (11). Opens 4px below its Select trigger, left-aligned to it.",
